WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:03.120
What the heck is Consensus Reality?

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:05.760
And is it really the answer to everything?

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:08.480
You may have seen us mention the subject before.

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:13.680
Consensus Reality after all, is what the SCP
Foundation is trying to preserve in the face

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:19.360
of ever-increasing anomalous activity: A kind
of “truth” or “normalcy” that all

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:20.720
of us can agree on.

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:25.760
Pick ten people at random and ask them: “What
color is the sky?”, “What gaseous element

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:30.240
is produced by trees?”, “Has every US
President since Washington secretly been an

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:31.920
alien reptile in disguise?”

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:37.680
The answers will, or at least should be “Blue”,
“Oxygen”, and “No.”

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:40.080
This is Consensus Reality.

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:40.320
But…

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:41.040
No.

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:42.720
Not really.

00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:46.880
Yes, in a more casual sense, “the state
of reality to which we all agree” could

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:51.840
be a viable definition of the term “Consensus
Reality”, but you likely don’t remember

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:56.240
being called upon for a vote along with the
rest of humanity on what is and isn’t quote

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:57.920
unquote normal.

00:00:57.920 --> 00:01:03.440
That’s because Consensus Reality isn’t
the consensus of everyone, it’s the consensus

00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:07.600
of the most powerful beings alive: The O5
Council.

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:13.600
In this instance, SCP-001 is the ever-updating
document that records exactly what “Normal”

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:14.320
is.

00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:19.840
But perhaps even more important, is that anything
that exists outside the Council’s most recent

00:01:19.840 --> 00:01:23.680
definition of “Normal” is targeted for
containment.

00:01:23.680 --> 00:01:27.920
While, at face value, it seems less flashy
than something like The Gate Guardian, or

00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:33.040
the terrifying Scarlet King, or the insane
twists and turns of the Ouroboros Cycle, the

00:01:33.040 --> 00:01:37.920
document defining Consensus Reality - despite
being the only thing on the database to be

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:45.040
given the classification “Non-Anomalous”
- is about as, ahem, Foundational, as Foundation

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:46.400
documents get.

00:01:46.400 --> 00:01:52.080
Literally everything currently in containment
is there because this document deems it so.

00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:58.400
It’s the SCP Foundation’s Ten Commandments
of Containment, and Thou Shalt Contain.

00:01:58.400 --> 00:02:03.920
If this document was ever leaked, it could
lead to a complete Broken Masquerade scenario,

00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:07.040
where the anomalous cat is let fully out of
the bag.

00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:12.640
Only the O5 Council has access to the document,
and it’s only through consensus that additions,

00:02:12.640 --> 00:02:15.360
alterations, or removals can be made.

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:20.960
Naturally, it’s a document that’s in extremely
high demand among the anomalous community,

00:02:20.960 --> 00:02:25.040
because it answers the big question that every
anomalous individual has:

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:29.360
“If I’m not even dangerous, if I’ve
committed no crime that would necessitate

00:02:29.360 --> 00:02:34.400
the locking up of a non-anomalous human, why
am I still being contained?”

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:35.440
And don’t worry.

00:02:35.440 --> 00:02:37.840
Today, we’re going to answer that question.

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:40.480
Or rather, the O5 Council will.

00:02:40.480 --> 00:02:42.800
But let’s return to the Council themselves.

00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:48.240
We’ve covered them and their many interpretations
before: From them being a group of fantastical,

00:02:48.240 --> 00:02:50.640
immortal demigods, to being a frightening&nbsp;

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:53.760
hive mind, to being a shadowy&nbsp;
faction of mysterious,

00:02:53.760 --> 00:02:59.200
emotionless bureaucrats, constantly conniving
and undermining each other to gain just that

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:00.880
little bit more power.

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:04.983
But what’s more frightening: The keys to
normality being in the hands of these larger

00:03:04.983 --> 00:03:10.160
than life, fantastical figures, or in the
hands of human beings, just as fallible and

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:15.040
afraid as the rest of us - with only the knowledge
of the strange things going on behind the

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:18.240
curtain to protect them from the truly unknowable?

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:23.920
The O5 Council holds meetings with some regularity
where they ask themselves and each other whether

00:03:23.920 --> 00:03:28.240
any new developments in the wider world require
changes to the New Normal.

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:31.040
It is up to the O5 Council&nbsp;
to define the difference&nbsp;

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:34.320
between universal laws - gravitation, physical

00:03:34.320 --> 00:03:41.600
forces, and basic chemistry, biology, sociology,
psychology, technology, and philosophy - and

00:03:41.600 --> 00:03:46.240
the kind of crackpot theories being spouted
by people on street corners carrying “The

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:48.160
End is Nigh” signs.

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:52.000
Some of their decisions are quite simple:
Can a new development be explained by the

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:54.720
laws of an existing, non-anomalous framework?

00:03:54.720 --> 00:03:57.120
If so, the rules need not be changed.

00:03:57.120 --> 00:04:01.120
The current paradigm of our understanding
can rest neatly in place.

00:04:01.120 --> 00:04:04.000
But other decisions fall into a grey area.

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:08.320
In order to illustrate this, we’re going
to do something unprecedented.

00:04:08.320 --> 00:04:14.480
We’re going to go into the actual boardroom
of the O5 Council, and see exactly what decisions

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:20.560
they made about our Consensus Reality, the
one that you and I are living in right now.

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:27.280
We’re going to look at three different meetings,
one from 1932, another from 1945, and a final

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:30.000
example from as recently as 2014.

00:04:30.880 --> 00:04:36.240
So what really goes on in the discussions
that define what we all would consider normal?

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:41.760
The 1932 discussion was spurred on by a strange
development happening in the United Kingdom.

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:47.120
New forms of Occult-adjacent Witchcraft and
spiritualism were beginning to take off, descended

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:50.240
largely from traditional Pagan and Wicca beliefs.

00:04:50.240 --> 00:04:54.320
The fact that some of these believers were
actually attempting spells was enough to catch

00:04:54.320 --> 00:04:59.840
the Foundation’s all-seeing eye, and the
matter was discussed by the O5 Council.

00:04:59.840 --> 00:05:02.800
O5-3 said, “Why are we even covering this?

00:05:02.800 --> 00:05:06.320
There are traditional beliefs in cultures
throughout history that we do not consider

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:07.120
anomalous.

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:10.960
We must not use our position to threaten the
right of humanity to believe.”

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:17.200
With a stern look, O5-7 replied, “Except
this does not extend from traditional practices.

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:22.400
This new "witch-craft" is a modern invention,
developed through a scholarly rereading of

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:25.120
practices as an alternative to Christianity.

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:29.440
It is not a continuation, and practitioners
are attempting spell-casting.”

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:34.160
O5-5 chimed in with, “Soon you'll say Aleister
Crowley has something to do with it.

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:39.360
The document is clear: theurgy is anomalous,
religion and spirituality are not.

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:42.960
Show me proof that they are casting spells
that cannot be explained under rigorous testing,

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:46.160
and I will personally see to containing those
spells myself.

00:05:46.160 --> 00:05:50.640
Until then, no, just as Thelema is allowed,
so shall this witch-craft.

00:05:50.640 --> 00:05:55.760
For God's sake, we'll allow Satanism as long
as they aren't channeling demonic energies.”

00:05:55.760 --> 00:06:00.080
O5-1, the most senior member of the Council,
nodded and said, “Agreed.

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:05.040
Furthermore, we will need all the faith we
can muster against the theurgic traditions.

00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:08.880
We never know when a new faith will assist
in our cause.”

00:06:08.880 --> 00:06:11.760
No updates to consensus reality were made.

00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:17.760
In 1945, an event of far greater magnitude
took place: The use of terrifying, new weapons

00:06:17.760 --> 00:06:23.520
by the US Military in Hiroshima and Nagasaki,
that resulted in the deaths of over 200,000

00:06:23.520 --> 00:06:24.160
people.

00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:28.400
The Council converged to discuss the earth
shattering event, and what their reaction

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:29.680
to it should be.

00:06:29.680 --> 00:06:34.240
Shaking, O5-2 said, “Thank you for responding
to my emergency call.

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:35.760
Trinity has happened.

00:06:35.760 --> 00:06:37.520
I can barely comprehend what I saw.

00:06:37.520 --> 00:06:42.560
It was like the sun rising from the desert
sand, a dawn of destruction and fire that

00:06:42.560 --> 00:06:44.080
lasted for miles around.

00:06:44.080 --> 00:06:47.840
I cannot believe that such an explosion could
ever be seen as possible.

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:51.600
Tales and prior evidence of the summoning
of gods have had less impact.

00:06:51.600 --> 00:06:56.320
I tremble with fear about the possibility
of people wielding this kind of power, the

00:06:56.320 --> 00:06:59.360
ability to level a city with the flick of
a switch.”

00:06:59.360 --> 00:07:03.920
O5-4 replied, “Weren't the Germans and Russians
also developing this technology?

00:07:03.920 --> 00:07:06.880
We are at war, and this sort of escalation
happens.”

00:07:06.880 --> 00:07:11.120
O5-5 said, “May I remind my esteemed colleague
that we are not at war?

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:14.080
The United States, Japan, they are at war.

00:07:14.080 --> 00:07:15.440
We are not nations.

00:07:15.440 --> 00:07:18.240
No, the question stands: is this anomalous?

00:07:18.240 --> 00:07:20.800
Do the physical effects&nbsp;
follow from the mathematical&nbsp;

00:07:20.800 --> 00:07:21.920
concepts?”

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:25.120
O5-7 replied, “They do follow.

00:07:25.120 --> 00:07:29.120
Scientific testing was completed each and
every step of the way to reach this point.

00:07:29.120 --> 00:07:33.760
I do not believe this is anomalous, no matter
how frightening the repercussions are.”

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:38.160
O5-2, still understandably worked up, said,
“What, you're just going to let people hold

00:07:38.160 --> 00:07:39.920
onto the keys to their own destruction?

00:07:39.920 --> 00:07:44.160
We have fought tooth and nail to keep such
capabilities out of the reach of man, and

00:07:44.160 --> 00:07:46.560
you're now saying we should abandon our purpose?”

00:07:46.560 --> 00:07:49.920
O5-5 said, “We do not prevent destruction.

00:07:49.920 --> 00:07:52.320
We sequester the anomalous.

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:56.080
And as long as we agree that the test was
arrived at through diligent scientific process,

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:57.280
available to anyone -”

00:07:57.280 --> 00:07:59.840
But 05-2 simply wasn’t having it.

00:07:59.840 --> 00:08:02.000
He shot back with, “Available to anyone?

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:03.440
Listen to yourself, man!

00:08:03.440 --> 00:08:08.080
Can you imagine a future where any two-bit
dictator chooses to unleash the fire of a

00:08:08.080 --> 00:08:10.560
thousand suns wherever he wishes?

00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:12.640
Maybe the problem isn't with the equations.

00:08:12.640 --> 00:08:15.440
Maybe the whole of nuclear physics is anomalous
itself.”

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:21.360
O5-1 once again brought his own level-headed
perspective to the table: “Enrico Fermi

00:08:21.360 --> 00:08:27.200
has already received a Nobel Prize for his
work on transuranic elements and radioactivity.

00:08:27.200 --> 00:08:30.400
We can't just secure nuclear physics from
the world.

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:36.240
Radioactivity is everywhere, and we end up
causing more contradictions when we try to

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:38.480
send ourselves back to the Dark Ages.

00:08:38.480 --> 00:08:42.240
Try explaining chemistry without referring
to covalent bonds.

00:08:42.240 --> 00:08:44.000
Try explaining biology.

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:49.440
Nuclear physics is here to stay, and we had
better get used to the consequences of this,

00:08:49.440 --> 00:08:53.920
no matter how terrifying this will be for
the planet and for humanity.”

00:08:53.920 --> 00:08:59.520
With a rattling sigh, O5-2 once again took
a seat, murmuring, “May God have mercy on

00:08:59.520 --> 00:09:00.400
our souls…”

00:09:00.400 --> 00:09:04.960
In the aftermath of this debate, the document
on Consensus Reality was altered to reflect

00:09:04.960 --> 00:09:09.520
these new developments in nuclear physics,
as frightening as they were.

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:14.080
I think we can all form a consensus on the
fact that one-off murder is a less depressing

00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:15.680
subject than mass murder.

00:09:15.680 --> 00:09:20.720
And it was a single murder that led to the
O5 Council discussing the concept of Worms

00:09:20.720 --> 00:09:23.120
That Walk in 2014.

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:27.920
O5-6 came to the table with, “For those
unfamiliar with the topic, the "worm that

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:32.400
walks" is a trope in which a character is
actually a writhing hive-mind of worms generally

00:09:32.400 --> 00:09:34.320
held together as a single mass.

00:09:34.320 --> 00:09:36.160
We are not here to discuss this trope.

00:09:36.160 --> 00:09:40.960
Instead, we are here to discuss the recent
conspiracy that has arisen from it.

00:09:40.960 --> 00:09:43.680
The conspiracy is the idea&nbsp;
that certain individuals&nbsp;

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:46.480
are actually worms that walk, and not humans.”

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:51.280
When asked if this conspiracy had any merit
to it, O5-6 replied, “No.

00:09:51.280 --> 00:09:55.440
Individual conspiracy believers are divided
themselves on who is a worm that walks and

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:59.760
who isn't, and all evidence indicates that
there aren't actual worms that walk in the

00:09:59.760 --> 00:10:00.960
general populace.

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:04.720
It pretty clearly falls under irreproducible
conspiracy theories.

00:10:04.720 --> 00:10:09.600
I believe there's nothing we need to do or
change in SCP-001.”

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:14.080
Another member of the Council wasn’t so
sure that these results were irreproducible,

00:10:14.080 --> 00:10:20.480
saying, “On 12/11/2013, a believer in the
conspiracy from Decatur, Alabama, killed his

00:10:20.480 --> 00:10:24.320
neighbor under the belief that the neighbor
was a worm that walks.

00:10:24.320 --> 00:10:29.200
The killer then took a video of his deceased
neighbor and uploaded it to YouTube, claiming

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:34.080
it was proof of the conspiracy, and that the
corpse was dissolving into individual worms

00:10:34.080 --> 00:10:35.520
before his very eyes.

00:10:35.520 --> 00:10:37.680
He said that he was going to take a sample.

00:10:37.680 --> 00:10:41.520
The video was very quickly blocked and removed,
and everyone who has viewed the video agrees

00:10:41.520 --> 00:10:45.040
that the subject is unmoving and does not
dissolve into worms.

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:49.520
The killer turned himself in to the police
while clutching a jar of Tubifex worms and

00:10:49.520 --> 00:10:51.600
the neighbor sent to the Morgan County morgue.

00:10:51.600 --> 00:10:56.880
Autopsy confirmed that the decedent was missing
a thumb postmortem and killed by gunshot to

00:10:56.880 --> 00:11:00.960
the chest - which, if he were a worm that
walks, would be survivable.”

00:11:00.960 --> 00:11:05.360
When questioned whether these were just the
actions of a single insane man, the Council

00:11:05.360 --> 00:11:10.400
member continued “The one item of interest
was that after the autopsy, the assistant

00:11:10.400 --> 00:11:13.680
coroner oversaw the return of the body to
the next of kin.

00:11:13.680 --> 00:11:18.240
The assistant coroner was also a conspiracy
believer, and despite not having had any prior

00:11:18.240 --> 00:11:23.280
contact to the parties involved, screamed
in disgust upon entering the examination room,

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:26.480
grabbing a mop and complaining about all the
worms everywhere.

00:11:26.480 --> 00:11:29.920
No one else noticed any&nbsp;
signs of worm infestation.”

00:11:29.920 --> 00:11:34.320
It was further discussed that D-Classes who
were shown the body didn’t see it as anything

00:11:34.320 --> 00:11:35.600
other than a corpse.

00:11:35.600 --> 00:11:40.320
However, after being told about the Worm that
Walks trope, several of them saw it as a writhing

00:11:40.320 --> 00:11:41.680
mass of worms.

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:45.600
Some believed that this could be a memetic
side effect of actually encountering a living

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:50.560
worm that walks, and updates were made to
the document to reference the possible existence

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:53.600
of perceptual mnestic worm triggers.

00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:58.000
So now you know what the O5 Council is up
to when not playing office golf or plotting

00:11:58.000 --> 00:12:02.400
each other’s downfalls: They’re having
discussions about witchcraft, war crimes,

00:12:02.400 --> 00:12:04.000
and walking worms.

00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:09.360
You’re probably feeling a pang of curiosity
about the actual SCP-001 document, especially

00:12:09.360 --> 00:12:13.920
if you’re an understandably vindictive anomalous
individual wondering why the Foundation is

00:12:13.920 --> 00:12:18.160
carting you off to paranormal Gitmo for the
simple crime of existing.

00:12:18.160 --> 00:12:22.960
And if you look for the true document, and
you manage to survive the memetic kill agents

00:12:22.960 --> 00:12:28.480
put in place to stop you, then what you’ll
actually find is even stranger: A letter,

00:12:28.480 --> 00:12:33.520
to you, from O5-5, explaining exactly what’s
happening to you.

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:34.640
The letter reads:

00:12:34.640 --> 00:12:35.280
“Hello.

00:12:35.280 --> 00:12:38.480
I'm afraid you won't find SCP-001 here.

00:12:38.480 --> 00:12:42.000
It's stored in a far more unreachable location
than this.

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:46.160
I'm sure you were hoping you could get in,
edit it in a couple places here and there,

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:50.720
and voilà, you're no longer anomalous, you're
free to go, the Foundation will harass you

00:12:50.720 --> 00:12:51.520
no longer.

00:12:51.520 --> 00:12:53.760
Of course, it can't be that easy.

00:12:53.760 --> 00:12:55.040
But I am going to help you.

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:56.480
You deserve this much.

00:12:56.480 --> 00:12:58.240
I'm going to tell you why.

00:12:58.800 --> 00:13:01.200
Why the Foundation targets you.

00:13:01.200 --> 00:13:04.960
Why we deem you something&nbsp;
to contain, to persecute.

00:13:04.960 --> 00:13:07.440
After all, there are far worse evils in the
world.

00:13:07.440 --> 00:13:10.720
We kept our record of nuclear weapons above
as an example.

00:13:10.720 --> 00:13:13.440
There are numerous genocides throughout history.

00:13:13.440 --> 00:13:17.120
The death toll from just the flu alone is
far greater that the potential damage for

00:13:17.120 --> 00:13:22.240
thousands of the people and objects we contain,
and yet we dedicate ourselves to branding

00:13:22.240 --> 00:13:24.160
you anomalous.

00:13:24.160 --> 00:13:25.760
Something not normal.

00:13:25.760 --> 00:13:27.920
Something inherently wrong.

00:13:27.920 --> 00:13:31.280
Something that cannot be allowed its peace.

00:13:31.280 --> 00:13:31.840
Why?

00:13:31.840 --> 00:13:35.520
I'm not going to patronize you and say there's
nothing I can do.

00:13:35.520 --> 00:13:40.480
I am only one voice on the Council, and I
can't change things on my own, that's true,

00:13:40.480 --> 00:13:46.560
but the decisions I make, and the way I let
myself view your circumstance are a direct

00:13:46.560 --> 00:13:50.480
cause of people seeing fit to throw you into
a box.

00:13:50.480 --> 00:13:56.640
Even if I can't change the document, I could
remain one more advocate for your normalcy.

00:13:56.640 --> 00:14:01.040
After all, humanity has believed in ghosts
and spirits for thousands of years.

00:14:01.040 --> 00:14:04.640
We all believe in the monster under our beds
when we're children.

00:14:04.640 --> 00:14:09.920
These phenomena are very real, and very much
a part of the way the world works.

00:14:09.920 --> 00:14:12.400
Why can't we just declare them normal?

00:14:12.400 --> 00:14:14.720
Why won't I free you from your torment?

00:14:14.720 --> 00:14:19.280
It's because we aren't only here to secure,
contain, and protect the world.

00:14:19.280 --> 00:14:23.520
We're here to secure, contain, and protect
you.

00:14:23.520 --> 00:14:27.840
The defining feature of the anomalous is that
it cannot be explained through simple scientific

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:28.560
testing.

00:14:28.560 --> 00:14:31.600
This makes you and your nature different.

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:32.640
Unique, even.

00:14:32.640 --> 00:14:34.800
And that scarcity makes it valuable.

00:14:34.800 --> 00:14:38.400
But that doesn't mean that your value is something
everyone can appreciate.

00:14:38.400 --> 00:14:42.480
Sometimes, it can only be appreciated by those
who would use it against you.

00:14:42.480 --> 00:14:46.640
That scarcity is also the tool by which a
monster can exploit you.

00:14:46.640 --> 00:14:51.520
Others aren't familiar with your anomaly,
and won't respond to descriptions of it as

00:14:51.520 --> 00:14:52.160
real.

00:14:52.160 --> 00:14:56.960
This gives opportunity to nefarious individuals
to exploit that lack of knowledge and use

00:14:56.960 --> 00:14:59.600
you as an eldritch pawn to their pleasure.

00:14:59.600 --> 00:15:05.920
They can isolate you, consume you, make your
anomaly their lever to destroy, slake a sadistic

00:15:05.920 --> 00:15:07.920
thirst with your existence.

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:09.520
I'm sure you've seen it happen.

00:15:09.520 --> 00:15:10.640
Someone is different.

00:15:10.640 --> 00:15:16.080
Their desires, needs, their reality forces
them to be ostracized by the world at large.

00:15:16.080 --> 00:15:17.280
They're left alone.

00:15:17.280 --> 00:15:21.760
Probably not friendless, but sidelined, starved
for connection.

00:15:21.760 --> 00:15:24.960
That's when someone swoops&nbsp;
in, promising greatness,&nbsp;

00:15:24.960 --> 00:15:27.440
but only offering that connection you crave

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:33.600
through consumption of you, destruction of
your world, perversion of your reality.

00:15:33.600 --> 00:15:37.760
You fight back, try to tell someone of your
plight, but others respond, "Oh, that can't

00:15:37.760 --> 00:15:38.320
be happening.

00:15:38.320 --> 00:15:39.520
That's not real.

00:15:39.520 --> 00:15:41.120
You must be mistaken."

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:45.440
You are alone in your anomaly, and left to
suffer.

00:15:45.440 --> 00:15:47.600
We can't let that happen.

00:15:47.600 --> 00:15:52.560
Yes, go ahead, point out that we're isolating
you at least as well, slowly consuming you

00:15:52.560 --> 00:15:57.280
and your existence just as surely as some
abuser might wish to burn you up.

00:15:57.280 --> 00:15:58.720
Call us monsters.

00:15:58.720 --> 00:15:59.600
It's okay.

00:15:59.600 --> 00:16:05.040
But keep in mind that even in our pursuit
of you, our coverup, our incarceration of

00:16:05.040 --> 00:16:11.600
you, we still want to make sure that you continue
to exist, that you aren't removed entirely

00:16:11.600 --> 00:16:12.880
from this world.

00:16:12.880 --> 00:16:15.440
You have every right to exist.

00:16:15.440 --> 00:16:18.560
You have every right to be as different as
you are.

00:16:18.560 --> 00:16:24.880
You, the monsters out there, the monsters
in here, you are all just as real as we are.

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:27.920
Just as real as the teeming,&nbsp;
irrational, self-destructive&nbsp;

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:30.640
humanity that remains ignorant to your plight.

00:16:30.640 --> 00:16:35.760
And the conclusion that we are all, in the
end, the same stuff, I hope you can find comfort

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:36.400
in it.

00:16:36.400 --> 00:16:38.960
Yes, you are a monster.

00:16:38.960 --> 00:16:43.280
But, whether we are deemed anomalous or not,
so is every last one of us.

00:16:43.280 --> 00:16:46.320
And that means you deserve your existence.

00:16:46.320 --> 00:16:47.600
We secure you.

00:16:47.600 --> 00:16:48.880
We contain you.

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:50.240
We protect you.

00:16:50.240 --> 00:16:55.840
And even if you still don't get why I'm doing
this, please understand that I still love

00:16:55.840 --> 00:16:56.320
you.”

00:16:56.320 --> 00:17:02.800
Now go check out “Children of SCP-001 The
Scarlet King - Is SCP-999 Really His Son?”

00:17:02.800 --> 00:17:08.000
and “SCP-001 Ouroboros Cycle - The Full
Story Compilation” for more perspectives

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:11.280
on the ever-elusive SCP-001!

